ues_count":85,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["agent-skills","db","embedded","faiss","fts","fulltext-search","hnsw","llm-memory","local","rag","search-engine","semantic-search","similarity-search","vector-database","vector-db"],"visibility":"public","forks":1014,"open_issues":85,"watchers":16127,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"## 问题描述\n\nZvec 的 Doc ID 校验规则不透明。当插入文档时，某些字符会导致 \\Invalid doc: doc[...] contains invalid characters\\ 错误，但：\n1. 文档没有说明哪些字符是允许的\n2. 错误信息没有指出具体哪个字符非法\n3. 校验规则对 Windows 路径不友好（无法使用文件路径作为 ID）\n\n## 复现\n\n\\\\\\python\nimport zvec, os, tempfile, shutil\n\ntmp = tempfile.mkdtemp()\nshutil.rmtree(tmp)\n\nschema = zvec.CollectionSchema(\n    name='test',\n    fields=[zvec.FieldSchema(name='x', data_type=zvec.DataType.INT64)],\n    vectors=[zvec.VectorSchema(name='v', data_type=zvec.DataType.VECTOR_FP32, dimension=2,\n             index_param=zvec.HnswIndexParam(metric_type=zvec.MetricType.COSINE, m=16, ef_construction=200))]\n)\ncol = zvec.create_and_open(tmp, schema)\n\n# 这些 ID 可以成功\nfor id in ['hello', 'hello-world', 'hello_world', 'hello.world', 'file.txt', 'C_path', '123']:\n    col.insert(zvec.Doc(id=id, vectors={'v': [1.0, 0.0]}, fields={'x': 1}))\n    print(f'  OK: {id!r}')\n\n# 这些 ID 会失败\nfor id in ['a/b', 'a:b']:\n    try:\n        col.insert(zvec.Doc(id=id, vectors={'v': [1.0, 0.0]}, fields={'x': 1}))\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f'  FAIL: {id!r} -> {e}')\n\nshutil.rmtree(tmp)\n\\\\\\\n\n输出：\n\\\\\\\n  OK: 'hello'\n  OK: 'hello-world'\n  OK: 'hello_world'\n  OK: 'hello.world'\n  OK: 'file.txt'\n  OK: 'C_path'\n  OK: '123'\n  FAIL: 'a/b' -> Invalid doc: doc[a/b] contains invalid characters\n  FAIL: 'a:b' -> Invalid doc: doc[a:b] contains invalid characters\n\\\\\\\n\n## 影响\n\n1. 用户尝试用文件路径做 ID 时会莫名其妙失败\n2. 调试困难：错误信息只说 \\contains invalid characters\\，没有指出哪些字符\n3. 与 Issue #395（Relax ID validation）相关，但 #395 关注的是放宽限制，而这里的问题是**校验规则不透明**\n\n## 建议\n\n1. 在文档中明确列出 ID 允许的字符集\n2. 改进错误信息，指出具体是哪些字符非法\n3. （可选）放宽 ID 限制，允许更多字符（如 / 和 :）\n\n## 环境\n\n- Zvec v0.5.1（pip 安装）\n- Windows 10 x64\n- Python 3.11","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba/zvec/issues/564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba/zvec/issues/564/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":30018622465,"node_id":"UNE_lADOQjAFnc8AAAABB-zG5M8AAAAG_T_UAQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba/zvec/issues/events/30018622465","actor":{"login":"feihongxu0824","id":237691413,"node_id":"U_kgDODiriFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237691413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824","html_url":"https://github.com/feihongxu0824","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feihongxu0824/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unassigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":